  _llmTemperature: 0.7
  _llmGuide: "BEGINNER'S GUIDE:\n- You start in L\xE0ng Tone. Follow the main quests of the village chief Tajima in order: they teach the basics, give rewards and unlock new maps. When unsure, choose the quest.\n- Without a weapon you cannot fight: Tajima gives a wooden sword.\n- Shops open after quest 3 (NV di\u1EC7t s\xEAn tr\u1EEB c\xF3c). Kiriko sells HP/MP potions, Tabemono food. Carry potions before long hunts.\n- Monsters drop yen (about one kill in ten) and sometimes items; drops are owner-only for 30 seconds, then public until they expire.\n- Train on monsters from your level to about 3 levels above. Far stronger ones kill you; ones 10 levels below give no experience.\n- At level 10, after quest 8 (visit the 3 schools), join your school: Hirosaki (ki\u1EBFm, phi ti\xEAu), Ookaza (kunai, cung) or Haruna (\u0111ao, qu\u1EA1t). Then read the school's book and use its weapon.\n- Potential and skill points are spent for you. When a quest step needs a level, hunt until you reach it.\n- If you die you return to the village with full HP; learn from it and avoid that monster for a while."
